<ul>
<li><b>Browse privately in a live review.</b> Click the LIVE chip at the top of the picture and it reads <b>FOLLOW</b>: the room&#8217;s playhead no longer moves you and yours no longer moves the room, while notes and marks keep flowing. Click it again to snap back to wherever the room is now. Same as the web page&#8217;s chip.</li>
</ul>
